;
; Derived exclusively from the official Microsoft CE
; documentation pages: each name below appears on the
; listed page whose Requirements row names this link
; library (wince-docs-corpus; page ids recorded in
; docs/def-audit-coredll-2026-09-18.tsv).  No
; shared-source/device-dump/VS/PB-derived name is used.
; Ordinals are not published; entries are name-only.
; LIBRARY tag = documented Link Library row (Coremain.lib); the on-device
; module name is not published by the CE documentation.
LIBRARY coremain.dll
EXPORTS
  DeleteCriticalSection
  EnterCriticalSection
  InitializeCriticalSection
  LeaveCriticalSection
